\description{
Unified entry point for occupancy, abundance, distance, removal, and related
models that share the latent-state-plus-imperfect-detection generative
template. The specific model is chosen via the \code{family} argument; the engine
(Laplace / nested Laplace / NUTS) via \code{engine}.
}
\examples{
\dontrun{
# Single-season occupancy
fit <- tobs(
  formula   = ~ elev,
  data      = sites,
  family    = occu(),
  detection = ~ effort,
  y         = y_matrix
)
}

}
